/**
 * The canvas-only knowledge-graph page, served to the panel's iframe.
 *
 * This is deliberately a standalone page rather than a React component for the
 * first version: the prototype's mind-map layout, pan/zoom and detail panel are
 * already proven, and embedding them keeps the read-only loop small. The page
 * owns no data and makes no requests; the panel posts the permission-filtered
 * graph payload into it with `postMessage`.
 *
 * The markup is generated from the design prototype with the prototype's rail,
 * mock table and mock icons removed -- those belong to the panel, which already
 * has real ones.
 *
 * @module @sparkelf/dsh-knowledge-base/graph-canvas
 */

